        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T16:35:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "False would mean that OEM unlock is not allowed and if this stub default is being used rather than implementing it in a meaningful way it shouldn\u0027t be preventing people from unlocking their phones.\n\nIt is ok to not have an implementation of this HAL, the system server will work around that.",
      "parentUuid": "4cfa2160_dc2ee79a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 33,
